Q: GitHub: Render markdown in code comments / docblock? A: <p>may be a bit late, but I basically created what you wanted a while ago. It works similar to what you wanted, see below.</p>
<pre><code>/*
# Markdown here?
- list?
*/
function MyClass(){
  this.someMethod = function(){
    // this method is added to each new instance
    // for this reason, adding your methods here can bloat
  };  
}
</code></pre>
<p>Find more here: <a href="https://explicode.com/" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://explicode.com/</a></p>
